                  "reading": "The author modified an import that now reads `useUpdateProfile` from `@/routes/account/use-profile`, where it read `@/hooks/use-profile`. The alias `@/*` maps to `src/*` in `tsconfig.json`, so the path resolves to the moved file, and [`useUpdateProfile()` is the same function there](code:src/routes/account/use-profile.ts#L10-18). [`<ProfileForm />` calls `useUpdateProfile()` for `saveProfile`](code:src/routes/account/components/ProfileForm.tsx#L8), so that the form saves the profile as before now that `src/hooks/use-profile.ts` no longer exists.",
